From: "xuan.huang" <5563315+Huxpro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:10:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(motion): add AnimatePresence and exit

AnimatePresence keeps removed keyed children rendered inside a presence
context. Motion components register with their presence child, animate
their own exit (or an inherited exit label) when it is no longer present,
and report completion; the child is released once every member settles.
Components with nothing to animate release immediately. Supports custom,
initial={false}, onExitComplete, re-entry before exit completes, and
mode='wait'.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
