+---
+"@lynx-js/motion": patch
+---
+
+Add `AnimatePresence` and the `exit` prop. Removed children stay mounted until their exit animations complete, exit labels propagate through variants, `custom` resolves exit variants, `initial={false}` skips the first mount animation, and `mode="wait"` renders an entering child after exiting children are removed.
